# Post copy after media

After every generated or finished **video** or **photo**, include post-ready copy in the same reply. Do not wait to be asked.

## Required block

1. **Description** — 1–3 short lines. Name the subject, the vibe, and the on-screen line if there is one. Write it so it can paste into TikTok / Reels / Shorts.
2. **Hashtags** — one line, 8–15 tags. Mix subject + mood + format. No filler spam.

```
# ❌ BAD
Saved the mp4. Open it when you want.

# ✅ GOOD
**Description:** Cabin POV. Tunnel lights. One line on screen: I will own a Porsche.
**Hashtags:** #Porsche #911 #LuxuryCars #Motivation #Manifest #DarkLuxury #CarTok #Reels #Shorts
```

Skip this block only when no media was produced (debug, script-only, failed render).
